Overgrown Firebreaks is an independent, unofficial compatibility addon.

Burnt Basic is created by Pixelbank.
Overgrown Vegetation is created by yayuy_0227 / yayuy.
Minecraft is a product of Mojang Studios / Microsoft.

The addon contains original compatibility rules and documentation. References
to third-party registry identifiers identify required blocks and tags; no
third-party mod binaries, source code, textures, models, animations, sounds,
or logos are included. Original mods must be obtained separately.

